OL,3,AThree things we've learnt about the UK
OL,4,Aeconomy from the IMF
OL,5,
OL,6,FCountries around the world have had
OL,7,Ftheir future economic prospects
OL,8,Fassessed by influential body, the
OL,9,FInternational Monetary Fund (IMF).
OL,11,FWhat the IMF says matters - it aims to
OL,12,Fkeep the global economy stable and its
OL,13,Ftwice-yearly forecasts are one of the
OL,14,Fmost authoritative looks at what is
OL,15,Freally going on around the world.
OL,17,FYet like all forecasts they can also
OL,18,Fturn out to be incorrect, so they
OL,19,Fshouldn't be treated as gospel.
